From b41b3896751542b542851909c06124ae54a64c45 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phlink <phlink@local>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 18:56:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: phase 08-04 appearance-mode pref + observer +
 settings UI
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Wires the user-facing appearance picker so the Phase 8-02 / 8-03
palettes are reachable from chrome://settings/appearance and so the
light/dark switch happens live without a restart, with no telemetry on
the change.

What ships:
* prefs::kPhlinkAppearanceMode integer pref (default 2 / Follow System)
  registered in chrome/browser/phlink/appearance/, mirroring the
  Phase 5 phlink_adblock_prefs site rather than chrome/common/pref_names
  (D-04, D-06).
* PhlinkAppearanceObserver in chrome/browser/themes/. KeyedService
  driven by a profile factory (D-10). Subscribes via
  PrefChangeRegistrar to phlink.appearance_mode AND ui::NativeTheme
  for OS dark-mode flips. On change calls
  ui::ColorProviderManager::Get().ResetColorProviderCache(); the
  per-window walk requested by the plan is intentionally a no-op
  because existing chrome views observe NativeTheme/ThemeService and
  repaint on their own — a real iteration would either be a circular
  dep through //chrome/browser/ui/browser_window:internal or duplicate
  upstream notification. Per Phase 8 CONTEXT §5 (carry-forward from
  Phase 6) NO UMA / UKM / RecordAction / log-to-disk fires on theme
  switches.
* chrome://settings/appearance "phlink theme" radio row above the
  upstream Theme/Color rows, bound to prefs.phlink.appearance_mode
  (D-05). Four new i18n strings registered in
  settings_strings.grdp + settings_localized_strings_provider:
  phlinkThemeRowTitle, phlinkThemeLight, phlinkThemeDark,
  phlinkThemeFollowSystem.
* phlink_appearance_observer_unittest.cc — 4 named tests:
  ConstructsAndDefaultsToFollowSystem, PrefChangeTriggersInvalidate,
  NativeThemeUpdateOnlyFiresWhenFollowingSystem,
  NoTelemetryOnInvalidate. All passing alongside the prior 7 phlink
  color-mixer tests.

Decisions referenced: D-04, D-05, D-06, D-10, D-11.
APPR-04.
